<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-kicker">备份</view>
    <view class="hero-title">导出组织资料</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">把猫档、地点、资产、捐助、投喂和工作量存到手机。不含每日任务正文，避免覆盖群友填过的档案。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">这次会带上</view>
    <view class="muted mt12" wx:for="{{sheets}}" wx:key="title">{{item.title}} {{item.rows}} 条</view>
    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!sheets.length}}">点下面导出后会列出条数。</view>
    <view hover-class="btn-hover" class="btn" bindtap="exportAll">导出并保存到本地</view>
    <view class="tiny mt12">会复制一份，并打开文件。转发到文件传输助手就能留在手机里。</view>
  </view>
</view>
